t.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-42_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-43_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="28e9e1d8-2e6f-4b37-9c88-d6401ce088b3" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>When will the next package be shipped?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="28e9e1d8-2e6f-4b37-9c88-d6401ce088b3" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-45_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-46_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-47_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-48_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-50_">We will send you details of the wines you are due to receive on the 1st of the month prior to shipping (i.e. February and October). The cut-off date for changes and updates will be 2 weeks later, on the 15th of that month.We will start sending out the wines on the 15th day of the shipping months (i.e. March and Novemeber).</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-51_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-52_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="88d6401c-e088-4396-9ccf-441e8b8b0bd2" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>I will be away during my next shipment, what can I do?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="88d6401c-e088-4396-9ccf-441e8b8b0bd2" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-54_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-55_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-56_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-57_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-59_">If you will be away during the time of shipping, you can re-route your shipment to an address (within Portugal), that will be able to receive it on your behalf. Simply log in and edit shipping details for current shipment.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-60_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-61_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="cf441e8b-8b0b-42a6-b45d-b8b657dc1fc6" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I change the address my wine is shipped to?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="cf441e8b-8b0b-42a6-b45d-b8b657dc1fc6" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-63_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-64_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-65_"><p class="sc-gFmZvT AnfjJ pf-66_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gwZLmR bKBQrY pf-68_">If you have moved or would like to permanently change your shipping address you can do this by logging in to your account and editing the shipping address (within Portugal).</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-69_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-70_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="5db8b657-dc1f-4602-a052-bf4503ec4f3a" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I add more wine to my package?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="5db8b657-dc1f-4602-a052-bf4503ec4f3a" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-72_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-73_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relat